 International  Development we managed to get the  funding and technical assistance for a  project where we really put together a  team to study this illicit excavation  phenomena try to understand the scale of  the problem the motives why the people  are engaged in this weather this because  of really ignorance lack of  understanding of the value of cultural  heritage ideology we don't know why  there are really a combination of  different reasons and also to try to  find after understanding the root causes  of this phenomena to find the solutions  and solutions at different levels  whether legal or try to implement some  awareness campaigns or working with the  local community which is really the key  the local community and working and  cooperating with the local community is  very important approaching this project  and the project is built up by doing a  country survey try to understand the  scale of the problem and then understand  the root causes and after that  working with focus group in different  archaeological sites in the North in the  middle and the south of the country we  have selected some sites and working  with local community try to analyze and  understand really what's happening and  these are the main activities of the  project the country survey and working  on the legislation's in the country so  we will have a proposal for the  amendment of the Jordan antiquity law we  think this is there are serious flows in  in the legislation and try to come up  with really an awareness campaign  organized with the Ministry of Education  so we'll produce like an awareness kit  for schools and for university so we  organized also a series of workshops  with the target groups like you know  targeting customs the police all people  dealing with cultural heritage and the  local community through a series of  workshops and we are working now on the  amendment of the law so we'll have a  proposal for an amended law to be  presented to the Parliament through the  channels to be approved and we will  implement our educational awareness kit  probably next month thank you very much  you
 

